        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">Teenagers need to be understood far more than they need to be instructed. The work usually runs on two parallel tracks: the young person's own sessions and regular parent consultations. For younger children, see our <a href="/en/services/child-psychology.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">child psychology</a> page.</p>
